      <h2>About Scubafish Zanzibar</h2>
      <p>Scubafish Zanzibar operates from Nungwi and Kendwa offering PADI courses from Discover Scuba to Divemaster, daily guided Mnemba Atoll dives, snorkeling trips, and sunset dhow-dive combos. Small groups (max 4 divers per guide), experienced local guides, and flexible scheduling for resort guests. Focus on safety, marine life education, and relaxed pacing. Beachfront locations with resort partnerships across north coast. Equipment rental, nitrox, and underwater photography services available.</p>

